# Caching and Optimization Rules for Invotek

## Caching Strategy

When implementing caching in the project, follow these guidelines:

### Dio Cache Interceptor Integration

- Use `dio_cache_interceptor` with `HiveCacheStore` for API caching
- Implement cache service in `core/services/cache_service.dart`
- Configure cache options for offline behavior
- Set appropriate cache duration and priority

### Cache Implementation Pattern

```dart
// Cache service setup
class CacheService {
  late CacheStore _cacheStore;
  late CacheOptions _cacheOptions;
  late Dio _dio;

  Future<void> initialize() async {
    final directory = await getTemporaryDirectory();
    _cacheStore = HiveCacheStore(directory.path);

    _cacheOptions = CacheOptions(
      store: _cacheStore,
      hitCacheOnNetworkFailure: true,
      maxStale: const Duration(days: 7),
      priority: CachePriority.normal,
    );

    _dio = Dio()
      ..interceptors.add(DioCacheInterceptor(options: _cacheOptions));
  }
}
```

### API Service with Caching

```dart
@RestApi()
abstract class ApiService {
  factory ApiService(Dio dio, {String baseUrl}) = _ApiService;

  static Future<ApiService> create() async {
    await CacheService.instance.initialize();
    final dio = CacheService.instance.dio;

    // Add logging interceptor
    dio.interceptors.add(PrettyDioLogger());

    return ApiService(dio, baseUrl: 'https://api.example.com');
  }
}
```

